{
  "version": "2.21",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "qk0001",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "设计稿说明",
      "width": 500,
      "fill": "$bg-sidebar",
      "cornerRadius": 12,
      "stroke": "$border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 10,
      "padding": 20,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qk0002",
          "name": "标题",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "v0.6.0 终端快捷按键输入面板 — Phase 0 设计稿",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qk0003",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• R18 入口按钮：#terminal-controls 首子元素（Refresh 之上），term-ctrl-btn 同风格 32px / coarse 44px；桌面同显、功能等价（N-5）；仅 title 无 aria（N-3）",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qk0004",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• R19 绑定：可见性 = 活动会话 quickKeysOpen 旗标；面板贴按钮列左侧展开、顶缘对齐入口按钮（设计评审①）；收起 = 再点入口按钮 toggle（左展不遮入口，恒可再点）；切实例随会话隐藏、回切恢复；删实例 / 切 worktree / web kind 由「无活动会话即隐藏」一条规则覆盖",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qk0005",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 尺寸纪律（M-1/R2-2/R3-1 + 设计评审①改写）：容器 bottom:20px（top/bottom 双向偏移→高度确定，扣除状态行带）+ pointer-events:none（按钮/面板 auto，空档不吞终端交互）；面板 absolute top:0 / right:calc(100%+8px)、max-height:100% + overflow-y:auto 内部滚动；max-width:calc(100vw-88px)（320 窄屏 ≤232px 退 2 列）；网格列数媒体查询分档（禁 auto-fit+shrink-to-fit 循环）",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qk0006",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• R20 键集 = 9 字节键（Esc/Tab/⇧Tab/方向按 applicationCursorKeysMode 选 SS3·CSI/^C/^D）+ Copy/Paste 共 11 键；pointerdown + preventDefault 保焦点不掉键盘；IME 组合态按会话排队 flush",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qk0007",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• R21 粘贴双路径：安全上下文 navigator.clipboard.readText()；裸 HTTP（iPad→Mac 主场景）→ 面板切换「粘贴兜底态」（同一 DOM、瞬态、隐藏即复位——M-2 选型 a）；bracketed 包装 iff bracketedPasteMode（同 vendored xterm 自带粘贴）",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qk0008",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• R22 复制：hasSelection → getSelection（桌面选区；TUI 需 Shift+drag）；否则视口文本（buffer.active 自动分态 pty 普通缓冲 / TUI alt screen）；writeText / execCommand 兜底",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qk0009",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 剪贴板归属：读写恒为浏览器所在客户端系统（remote 访问自动正确），不引入任何后端剪贴板通道（用户补充 2026-10-13）",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qk0010",
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 发送契约：term.input() 走键盘同一 onData 闸门（终态拒发 / 应答过滤 / WS-HTTP），零新传输代码；载荷族对 isTerminalQueryResponse 安全性已逐类核验",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
